    <comment>New package beads 1.3.2: bd, a graph issue tracker for AI coding agents on embedded Dolt; Go, 216 vendored modules.
- Usage metrics off by default: 0001-make-usage-metrics-opt-in.patch
- Legal: links MPL-2.0, LGPL-3.0 with exception, CC0, Unlicense and WTFPL modules; see spec.
- x86_64, aarch64 and ppc64le only: Dolt does not build on 32-bit.</comment>
